        "body": "Octel Networks proudly introduced NETKA to India as its exclusive distributor, bringing the platform to enterprise and infrastructure audiences for the first time. The launch gave businesses a direct look at what NETKA offers and how it fits into the network and infrastructure environments they run today.\n\nThe launch was hosted across two cities, Chennai and Bengaluru, in 2026. Each session brought together enterprise teams, infrastructure professionals and industry stakeholders for product introductions, discussions and conversations with the people who will deploy and support the platform.\n\nBy leading the launch, Octel took on more than a distribution role. We took responsibility for how NETKA is understood and adopted across the region, helping organizations evaluate it clearly and move forward with confidence.",
